He also noted that the investment of large Chinese companies has attracted other Chinese companies to turn their attention to and decide to do business in Cambodia, such as hydropower projects, new airport projects in Siem Reap, road construction projects. Speed and many other projects, such as the One Road Group and One Road Great Wall projects we have all been seeing today.
