* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the workers who participated in the fight against Kovid 19, especially the Kovid 19 vaccination.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the workers for their respect and love for Samdech. Samdech Techo considers this respect and love more than the leader is like a relative.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the meeting with workers was suspended during the election campaign, but must continue after the election.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the CPP has a specific leadership policy, although the King Kong step is moving forward slowly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kampong Cham will have a factory presence in the future.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that efforts must be made to prepare infrastructure to divert investment down to the provinces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the work of Khmer children is not bad. But more technical training is needed to extract the senior industry.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that before, some goods were sewn in Hong Kong and finished in Cambodia. But now it is sewn in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, Cambodia suffered because of Kovid 19, but Cambodia was still happy because Cambodia was peaceful.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the draft election law has been sent to the National Assembly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the intention to amend the election is not to obstruct and destroy the election.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the opposition suffered because their tongues had no bones.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned which foreign opposition group has the qualifications to be the Prime Minister?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the opposition has no youth to continue politics.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that even though Samdech was not the Prime Minister, he was still the party's president and political ruler.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no opposition group has the same ability as Hun Manet. Especially parachuting and shooting skills.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen issued an open order to the forces in the 1st Military Zone, especially in Ratanakkiri, Mondulkiri and Kratie provinces to jointly prevent the Vietnamese rebels from fleeing to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen suspects that the rebel leader who attacked Vietnam may be hiding in Cambodia. This is an organization with a clear assignment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces ban on foreign intervention in the case of Vietnamese rebels fleeing to Cambodia. If Cambodia catches it, it will be sent back to Vietnam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen orders increased research to prevent the rebels from hiding in Cambodia.
