The Deputy Prime Minister also thanked the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, Mr. Wang Winthean, and the working group, as well as all national agencies / agencies implementing the project, for their close support and cooperation with the Cambodian National Secretariat of Cooperation. Operation Mekong-Lanchang to implement these projects.
