* First, the approval in principle of the progress report, effectiveness and achievements in responding to the spread of HIV and AIDS for the first six months of 2023.
* Second: Continuing to promote the progress and implementation of the "Notification No. 213 of the Council of Ministers" dated 21 February 2019 of the Office of the Council of Ministers on measures related to the response to HIV and AIDS.
* Third: Approval of the decision of the first plenary meeting of the National AIDS Authority 2023 to continue to implement in response to HIV and AIDS to achieve the goal 95-95-95 in 2025 .
