Samdech Techo continued, "Please call on all of you to go to the polls, which are closed on July 22, 23 and 24, with your salary." If you register to vote in Phnom Penh, it is easier to take a three-day break. If the lottery is for everyone, do not believe in incitement, because this is our right. "In Australia, those who do not go to the polls are fined, but in our case, those who prevent them from going to the polls are fined."
