Colonel Prohm Yorn continued that in the case of the fire above, the fire on 2 floors of the 38th floor completely, which is a type of concrete (size 4 meters by 4 meters) will not spread to neighboring houses. Side.
As for the rescue operation, Colonel Prohm Yorn confirmed that 15 specialized office vehicles did not use water, 2 auxiliary vehicles from the Ministry of Interior did not use water, and 2 Olympia shopping malls did not use water. Use water.
Lt. Col. Prohm Yorn also confirmed that no one was injured in the fire. Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth: Harmonization of the registration system and management of social protection data will be the basis. Important foundations in implementing national social protection policy
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the National Council for Social Protection, on June 13, 2023, emphasized that the harmonization of the social protection registration and management system will become An important foundation for the implementation of national social protection policies.
This emphasis was made on the occasion of Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth's participation in the launching ceremony of the project to harmonize the registration system and management of social protection data "on June 13, 2023. The event was held at Sofitel Phnom Penh Phokitra Hotel.
Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth stated, "I would like to emphasize that the harmonization of the social protection registration and management system will be an important foundation in the implementation of national social protection policies with accountability, transparency, good governance, environment and Cell interconnection. ”
Therefore, Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth would like to encourage and request the relevant ministries and institutions and working groups in charge of implementing the National Social Protection Policy, which will use the digital social protection nursery and social protection database to pay attention to some main tasks. As follows:
1: Continuing close cooperation to ensure the success of the process of building the Cambodian social protection system through full digitalization to increase efficiency and expand the scope step by step.
2: Continue to review and study the strategic plan for digital transformation in the social protection system that is being prepared as well as the relevant regulations and make recommendations for the development, implementation and effective solution of cross-cutting issues (Cross-cutting Issues). To increase consistency and effectiveness, both in terms of implementing national social protection policies and digital social protection;
4: The inter-ministerial technical working group for the harmonization of the social protection data registration and management system must be ready to cooperate closely and provide additional support with a proactive spirit in order to expand the scope of this important project in the next phase throughout the country and
5. The General Secretariat of the National Council for Social Protection and the Secretariat of the Inter-Ministerial Technical Working Group must be ready to provide timely support and continue to coordinate this work to improve the quality and efficiency of digitalization in the protection system. Cambodian society to be better and better in accordance with the policy framework of the Royal Government.
