He said that through the election to be a Member of Parliament for Kampong Speu province for almost 10 years (2 terms), he was given the opportunity to join the Royal Government with the provincial administration to develop, repair and build various physical infrastructure. Much for the benefit of the people of Kampong Speu.
At the same time, in accordance with the spirit of the Constitution, on July 23, 2023, Cambodia will hold parliamentary elections for the 7th legislature, Mr. HUN Many called on all citizens on the list. Vote, be ready to go to the polls and vote for the party you love, especially the party that knows how to be happy and always with the people.
Taking this opportunity, he thanked the benefactors, the team, the director of the Department of Public Works of Kampong Speu and other parties who contributed to the construction of the bridge.
