Please be informed that the introduction of MRI, medical and surgical techniques to the team of doctors of Preah Keto Mealea Hospital due to the rapid development of medical technology, evolving scientific techniques, this factor requires sharing of experience. Go from doctor to doctor, between hospitals and hospitals, both in the country and abroad.
The workshop was also attended by a group of professional doctors with a presentation to share a lot of knowledge.
The nest contains 21 eggs, 17 of which are fertilized, moved to a safe place and are being hatched in artificial nests to ensure safety, while four non-fertilized eggs are kept in the nest. Original.
The artificial nest is surrounded and guarded throughout the day by our crocodile conservation community to protect the eggs from various dangers. We expect the eggs to hatch in mid-August and the crocodiles to be released back into the wild to ensure they have the highest chance of survival.
The total number of mountain crocodiles worldwide is estimated to be around 1,000, of which Cambodia has nearly 400 crocodiles, so the discovery of this nest in the wild is exciting news. Draft Law on Environment and Natural Resources and Draft Law on Approval of ASEAN Trade in Services Agreement Passed by Senate
