Samdech Techo Hun Sen: The preparation of amendments to the election law is a slap in the face of the opposition leader who campaigned for the people not to go to the polls (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia The upcoming amendment to the election law is a slap in the face to opposition leaders who have launched a campaign calling for people not to go to the polls in July 2023.
