(Preah Sihanouk): The Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration on June 13, 2023 issued a press release confirming that recently, anarchists have sneaked in and encroached on many hectares of acacia forest. Construction of 18 slum huts at O Trav point, Chamnot Ream village, Bit Trang commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province, in the multi-use area of Prek Teuk Sap, Kbal Chhay.
After receiving this information, on May 11, 2023, the rangers of Prek Teuk Sap Kbal Chhay multi-use area, in cooperation with the rangers of Sihanoukville Marine National Park, went to educate and instruct them to voluntarily dismantle. So far, the anarchists have not only refused to dismantle as instructed, but have also come together to build more huts.
On the morning of June 12, 2023, the Sihanoukville Provincial Administrative Unity Command, with the co-ordination of the Deputy Prosecutor of the Sihanoukville Provincial Prosecutor's Office, led a joint force to prepare order for the above location. As state property.
After listening to the legal explanations from the professional officers, all the anarchists agreed to dismantle and make a peaceful exit contract, while the provincial administration also facilitated the transportation of people and materials from the location to The original base, respectively.
It should be noted that the activities of the anarchist group above are an opportunity while the authorities are busy protecting security and public order in organizing the process of the upcoming 7th legislative election.
