Leaders of the Ministry of Labor promote the implementation of child protection policy to end child labor by 2025
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Soeng Sor Socheata, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training and Vice Chairwoman of the National Committee Against Child Labor, called on all stakeholders to implement the Child Protection Policy 2019-2029, especially the termination of labor. Children in 2025.
The Secretary of State made the remarks on the occasion of the 74th anniversary of International Children's Day, June 1, the 22nd anniversary of the World Day Against Child Labor, June 12 and the Cambodian Children's Day 2023, which was jointly held under the theme "Global Social Justice for All." Together to End Child Labor ”on June 12, 2023 at the Ministry of Labor.
In response to the Prime Minister's merits of children in the elimination of all forms of child labor, the Secretary of State made the following recommendations:
1. The National Committee Against Child Labor (NCCP) must continue to coordinate the implementation of international conventions and national policies related to child labor, especially in collaboration with inter-ministerial institutions to promote the implementation of the National Action Plan on the Reduction of Child Labor and the Elimination of Forms. The worst of child labor in 2016-2025.
2. General Secretariat of the NEC And the Department of Skills must work to strengthen effective labor inspection measures to prevent occupational hazards and occupational health and safety vulnerabilities for young workers in order to eliminate child labor in high-risk priority areas.
3. Continue to train and strengthen the capacity of all stakeholders and mobilize financial resources and seek public support to participate in the fight against child labor.
4. Expand awareness and campaigns against child labor and forced labor to localities and communities to prevent the use of child labor.
5. Strengthen core interventions to save child labor and ban forced labor, and increase cooperation between ministries, institutions and stakeholders to prevent the use of child labor in all its forms. Mr. Sem Sovanny Meets and Delivers Samdech Techo's Donation to 1,000 Party Members in Khnar Sanday Commune, Banteay Srey District
