* First name: Ngem Seng Thao, female, 44 years old, selling coffee in Thmey I village, Khsach Andet commune, Chhlong district, Kratie province.
* Second: Name: Kin Chhorn, Male, 40 years old, Occupation: Coffee seller in Phum Thmey II, Khsach Andet Commune, Chhlong District, Kratie Province, Unlicensed. And the police force has advised and contracted the owners of the above two locations to stop providing locations for all kinds of illegal gambling.
Please note that online cockfighting sites are not licensed, not only Chhlong district, but all districts in Kratie province, many places are playing in small cafes have not yet been completely cracked down and banned.
Citizens request the competent authorities to inspect and crack down on online cockfighting and other games, because these games cause some families to have quarrels, leading to domestic violence, broken couples, not only Only social insecurity can occur due to gambling.
