(Phnom Penh): Mr. Eang Sophalleth, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Party Working Group on Oreang Ov District, Tbong Khmum Province, emphasized, "As members of the Cambodian People's Party, we have three important roles to serve the people. The people of Ou Raing Ov district.
Mr. Eang Sophalleth made this remark during a meeting with more than 500 people from 10 villages in Damrel commune, Ou Raing Ov district on Saturday, June 10, 2023.
