Mr. Lok said that the main role of the leadership and working group of Ou Raing Ov district is:
+ The first important role: to implement the five priority policies of the Royal Government of Cambodia:
* People: Training, support and encouragement to build human resources through the construction of schools, rewards, organizing Sankrant events throughout the district in order to create fun, promote beauty and strengthen solidarity.
Roads: Campaign for smooth roads to repair more than 80 kilometers of roads throughout the district
* Water: Provide eight water wells and continue to provide 8 more wells equipped with hot and cold water filters in order to improve public health in the district.
* Lighting: Equipped with more than 2,000 solar lights and plans to install in every home.
* Social security is to maintain security and order through the policy of safe villages and communes, especially the suppression of all kinds of drug crimes.
+ The second important role is to respect and adhere to the implementation of our party's policies, principles and regulations, unity, internal unity and virtue.
+ The third important role: is to work effectively on the ground by building trust to respond in a timely manner to the real needs of our people and continue to build new party members by adhering to "keep the old create new".
