In that, the owner of the bidding company has committed and implemented the construction according to the design plan. The company that did not receive the bid also said that the bidding was transparent and acceptable.
At the same time, the director instructed all companies to build roads according to the design standards to be good and durable for the people and asked the local authorities to solve the impact of the people peacefully. To make the process of road construction smooth and fast for the people to use on time.
