Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call for peace together so that this growing country does not fall back into war (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Once again, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, continues to call on workers And the people together to keep the peace together to protect the interests of living in peace and continue to develop the nation, absolutely not to let this growing country fall back into war.
