Samdech Techo also reminded of the hardships during the war and said that if there is a war, do not talk about building roads, do not talk about building canals, schools, hospitals, pagodas.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen really does not want this growing country to fall back into war because the extent of the damage is enormous.
