Speaking during a visit to nearly 20,000 workers in Tram Kak district, Takeo province, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that other countries, even if they oppose each other, do not kill their own people, they give people the opportunity to have jobs and There are jobs by encouraging foreigners to invest in the country.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen mentioned the two former Thai Prime Ministers, their brothers never said a word, demanding that foreigners put pressure on Thai politics and economy. Unlike extremist politicians in Cambodia, some of us have children who work as laborers, but are told to punish Cambodia.
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued to call on workers to keep the peace together, because if there is no peace, everything will be destroyed and call on workers and bosses in the factory to maintain peace in the factory.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on all workers to go to the polls on July 23, 2023, and the good choice of the people is to vote for the Cambodian People's Party to protect peace and development.
