Samley commune chief told reporters on the afternoon of June 9 that Samley commune received a contract to improve two roads, the first project in Ta Por village to improve a road 1,370 meters long, 5 meters wide, paved with thick stone. 0.15 meters with 110 million riels auctioned on the morning of May 15, 2023, 3 companies submitted bids, the results went to Reaksmey Vongpheak company in the amount of 110 million riels.
