* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that local investment has made a significant contribution to society, economy and job creation for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the dynamic growth of the nation cannot be separated from the contribution of the duke, duke and compatriots.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the tycoon to maintain his reputation, honor and dignity as a tycoon worthy of the King's trust.
