* Samdech Techo Hun Sen is very proud and proud that this association was established at a time when the Royal Government of Cambodia is in need of strategic partnerships to achieve its vision of becoming a middle-income country. High level by 2030 and high income country by 2050.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen strongly hopes that the Cambodian Dukes Association will be the seedbed and the foundation of the network of cooperation, business and investment partners in Cambodia, as well as an indispensable partner of the Royal Government in increasing its role. Of Cambodia to be higher in the regional and global trade arena.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was very pleased to participate in the official announcement ceremony of the Cambodian Duke Association.
