(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of June 9, 2023, the Cambodian Association of Housing Developers issued an appeal instructing members of the Association of Housing Developers of Cambodia to stop foreclosure from clients facing economic crisis and to deal with Each with tenderness.
At the same time, the Cambodian Housing Developers Association will take immediate action by disseminating and appealing to the housing developers, who are members of the Cambodian Housing Developers Association, to examine the possibilities and implement the following:
First, do a detailed and in-depth study of the situation of customers who have debts and problems with the ability to pay.
Second, provide flexibility on payment terms and suspend foreclosure of clients experiencing personal economic crisis and real challenges.
Third, provide flexibility and facilitate customers who face the challenge of paying in installments with Borey and reorganizing credit.
Fourth, in case the company has confiscated the house or lost the money that the customer paid, please the company to review to return the money or refund to the customer or find a suitable solution to the customer gently.
