According to interviews with workers who attended the event, they all needed peace, needed leaders who cared for the people and for the workers as if no one needed war, insecurity. Leads to losing a good job as it is today.
Workers understand that Cambodia has a wise leader and strives to maintain peace, which leads to a series of investments in the country, and the investment also provides good job opportunities for them as a people to earn a living. In daily life.
