A man jumped to his death in Bokor Mountain in the middle of the night but fell next to a tree, the police took many hours to find and rescue the family
(Kampot): At the age of 24, a man decided to end his life by jumping from Bokor Mountain in the middle of the night on June 8, 2023, because he was upset with the last stage of meningitis, but this attempt to end his life Failed to do so, when he jumped down, he was stuck in a tree and was rescued by the authorities.
Speaking to Fresh News on the afternoon of June 8, Major General Mao Chanthurith, Kampot Provincial Police Commissioner, confirmed that he had received reports that a man had attempted suicide on Bokor Mountain behind Wat Sampov Pram. . He later ordered the Bokor City Inspectorate to cooperate with the relevant authorities to conduct an immediate search at the suspected location.
He added that after spending many hours in cooperation with military, security, company and environmental officials until 3 am on June 8, 2023, the police found the victim on the hillside. Below, when jumping down to the big trees. After the discovery, the authorities returned it to the victim's family.
According to the family of the victim, 24-year-old Chen Soben disappeared from the house, but did not know where to go, but later found a letter written by the victim to the family, confirming He said he would jump to his death on Bokor Mountain because he was upset with the last stage of encephalitis, which doctors said he had only two months left to live.
Seeing this description, the family sought the help of the police and provided information about where the victim was about to commit suicide, and the police immediately launched a search. However, at this time, the authorities have handed over the victims to their families to further educate them not to think short and end their lives like this. The scammer, Mom Asani, confessed to the authorities in the past, the case of cheating because he was addicted to gambling (Video inside)
