Cambodian Securities Regulator encourages investment in sustainable bonds in Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sou Socheat, Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the Securities Regulator of Cambodia, encouraged companies and potential investors to seize the opportunity to invest in sustainable bonds in Cambodia for companies planning to invest in sustainable bonds in Cambodia. Technical assistance from the Asian Development Bank (ADB).
Mr. Sou Socheat made the remarks at a seminar on "Potential Investment in Sustainable Bonds in Cambodia".
The purpose of this workshop is to promote and raise awareness of the benefits of sustainable bond issuance and investment in sustainable securities in Cambodia, and the need for businesses and potential investors to consider this issue, as well as to promote it. About ADB Technical Assistance to Support Sustainable Bonding Publishers in Cambodia.
"Cambodia is a developing country, so it is more vulnerable to climate change, we can not increase climate resilience without investing in climate change adaptation today," he said. "International support and development partners are contributing to climate change mitigation, which is why there is talk of investing in sustainable bonds in Cambodia."
He added that there is a great need for investors to see the value and opportunities of investing in sustainable development. Hopefully more companies will issue this bond in the future.
Prasat Balang District Authority Bids Publicly for So Kream Commune Road Project for Transparency
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Seng Sarath, Deputy Governor of Prasat Balang District, said that all bids for commune fund projects must be made public, transparent and eliminated for those who take the opportunity to take money for tea. This statement was made by the Deputy District Governor on June 08, 2023 during the bidding ceremony for the Sakram Commune Road Foundation Project in Prasat Balong District, Kampong Thom Province.
Mr. Seng Sarath requested all representatives of the participating companies to participate in the bidding, please bid freely and fairly, avoid any kind of collusion, because this is a budget for local development, so the bidding must be To be transparent and to build roads in accordance with technical standards.
He stressed that the bidding for the Commune / Sangkat Fund project must be made public in front of all bidders in order to be transparent and to absolutely avoid anarchy during the bidding process, especially to eliminate For those who take the opportunity to take money for tea. In particular, the winning bidder must comply with the technical terms and conditions of the contract.
The deputy district governor added that the seven commune authorities in Prasat Balong district need to strengthen the responsibility of organizing the bidding for the commune fund project on the success of the recent years. . In that, the people have the right to know about all the development work of any project in their locality as well.
