After that, Dr. Kao Thach visited O'Kleng Por Meanchey Agricultural Community, a group of cashew producers, cassava and rice washing services, soybean washing and processing of all cashews.
During the meeting, Dr. told the community members that the Royal Government of Cambodia has a policy to support and want to turn Cambodia into an all-cashew emperor in the future. In addition, in case any community or community member wants to get a loan to expand the cultivation or expand the cashew production line, you can apply for a loan from ARDB at a reasonable interest rate to buy fertilizer, cashew peeling machine, build a warehouse, dry and dry. Maintenance and so on.
Dr. stated that the interest rate of ARDB is a concession interest and is the consideration of the Royal Government for farmers in rural areas to expand the agricultural sector.
Dr. encouraged you to consider applying for a loan from ARDB Bank by using dried cashew stock as collateral when the market is down sharply, the bank can provide loans up to 70% of the value. Cashew nuts in stock.
He also suggested that community members should study the techniques of cultivation, care to increase production and processing in accordance with the food standard to sell to the market.
Taking that opportunity, Dr. Kao Thach also called on the people who have the right to vote to go to the polls on Sunday, July 23, 2023 for everyone not to miss.
