The business forum aims to promote business and investment between the two countries and discusses key topics, including: Investment opportunities in Cambodia 2. United Arab Emirates Investment Ecosystem 3. Cambodia's agricultural sector 4. Agriculture of the United Arab Emirates Services in the Cambodian tourism industry 6. Strategic Partnership Proposal Proposed by the United Arab Emirates Cambodian manufacturing sector 8. The future of the United Arab Emirates Sustainable Energy Sector.
