Mr. Phuong Sith confirmed that the payment of the policy to the poor with disabilities is in accordance with the policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia through the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation from 2018 to the present. There are two types of disability payments to the poor: the first type (severe level) for one year is 240,000 Riels, and the second type (medium level) for 6 months is 120,000 Riels.
