The Minister emphasized that the protection of natural resources and the conservation of biodiversity can only be successful if the local communities have a regular source of income and a prosperous life.
Mr. Say Sam Al emphasized that Cambodian bee products must meet local demand and be present in the international market, and to achieve this goal, there are three main priorities:
