Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Opening Ceremony of Phnom Penh-Bavet High Speed Construction Site
(Phnom Penh): The peace that has been hard to find under the hands and wisdom of Samdech Techo Hun Sen for more than 20 years is bringing rapid growth for the Cambodian nation. Many transport infrastructure achievements have also emerged, serving as a noble benefit to the once miserable nation of Cambodia.
Another new historical achievement in Cambodia, the Phnom Penh-Bavet Expressway, will begin construction on Wednesday morning, June 7, 2023. The Phnom Penh-Bavet Expressway is the second expressway in Cambodia after the Phnom Penh-Sihanoukville Expressway, which was officially launched in 2022.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Opportunity to open the construction site of Phnom Penh-Bavet high-speed construction:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the development of the nation has left Samdech geographically lost not only in Phnom Penh, but also in rural areas.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the expressway is very useful.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Phnom Penh-Bavet Expressway is an important connection between Cambodia and Vietnam as well as ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the original project to build the Phnom Penh-Bavet Expressway is also connected with the construction of the bridge across the Lower Mekong River and requires people to pay when crossing.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not want people to spend money on crossing the bridge, so he decided to release the national budget to build a bridge for people to cross free of charge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the Chinese ambassador not to stop providing aid because he saw that Cambodia has the ability to build a lot of infrastructure. Samdech Techo also wants to see China provide some assistance for the Phnom Penh-Bavet Expressway project.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that the Phnom Penh-Siem Reap and Poipet Expressway will sign a construction study this evening
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that China's cooperation in the Belt and Road Initiative has provided many benefits to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Belt and Road Initiative did not hinder the development of any country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of the expressway did not use loans, but was built with the money of all Chinese investors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the inauguration of the third ring road on June 30.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, there is no free time, there will always be programs for development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Chinese government has always respected Cambodia's decision to build achievements using Chinese loans. China has never ordered Cambodia to follow suit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was lucky to have two economic ministers and not a lazy minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the Chinese government for helping to build the Techo Heritage National Stadium, making it possible for Cambodia to host the SEA Games and the ASEAN Para Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expects that the leaders of ASEAN member countries will support Samdech's vision to make ASEAN sports events more famous.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks Vietnam to arrest Sam Rainsy if he enters Vietnamese territory. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that if Sam Rainsy enters Vietnam and Vietnam does not arrest him, there will be problems with Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people to go to the polls on July 23, 2023 and vote for the Cambodian People's Party to choose to maintain peace and development.
