Article 1 of the Prakas of the Ministry of Economy states that "Property tax is exempted until the end of 2023 for properties located in Udong Mechey town of Kampong Speu province, Arey Ksat city and Sampov Poun city of Kandal province and Bokor city of Kampot province." "
The Ministry of Economy added that all property owners in the city as defined in Clause 1 of this Prakas are obliged to register the property at the provincial tax branch where the property is located or at the Department of Property and Property Tax of the General Department of Taxation. However, there is no obligation to file a declaration and pay property tax until the end of 2023.
The Ministry stated that in the case of real estate in the city as defined in Clause 1 of this Prakas, the property tax has already been paid and the amount of tax paid has been allowed to be used as a reference loan for property tax deduction. For subsequent years.
The ministry added that property owners must apply for a property tax credit that has already been paid at the provincial tax branch where the property is located or at the General Department of Taxation for property tax deduction for subsequent tax years.
