(Kandal): A widow with two children, a karaoke bar manager, upset with her AIDS and liver disease, decided to commit suicide by hanging herself in Room 3 of Raksmey Angkor Guesthouse in Kampong Samnang Sangkat. Black eyes. This incident happened on June 4, 2023.
Victim: 35 years old, Occupation: Karaoke manager, living in Kampong Samnang village, Sangkat Kampong Samnang, Takhmao city, Kandal province.
After the incident, the Takhmao City Police Inspector ordered the Deputy Inspector of Justice and the scene analysis force to investigate the case.
Mr. Seng Ranout, a guesthouse employee, told the police that on June 3, 2023, at 5:00 PM, the victim came to stay at Raksmey Angkor Guesthouse, told him to stay for a while and went up to Room 3 to open the room. And air conditioning for the victims to rest.
After that, Sam Oeun, the staff of the guesthouse, came to continue the night shift, saying that Room 3 had not been paid yet until 23:00 on the same day, so he went up to the victim's room and knocked on the door to pay Did not answer, just thought to pay tomorrow.
According to the report, on June 4, 2023, at 11:00 AM, when the time came to leave, the staff of the guesthouse went to room 3 and knocked on the door to charge, but this room could not be opened and the field did not answer. The witness then called the team to stab him, but another internal key could not be opened.
Khoeun Sereya, a friend of the victim, said that the victim went to the hospital for a blood test for HIV and liver disease, and the victim was very upset. Danger to think a lot.
According to the police, the body was hard, there were black spots around the neck, teeth, tongue, blood, and there were no noticeable scars, and according to doctors, the victim died of suicide. A. The body was traditionally buried by the family. Ministry of Justice Spokesperson: Proclamation and rally against the election is a criminal offense for both individuals and political parties (Video inside)
