* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the good development in the field of education is due to the participation of all Cambodian society, including national leaders, school leaders, parents and students themselves.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his satisfaction with the development of women's capacity in Cambodia, especially many entrepreneurs are women.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his satisfaction with women who work hard to increase their capacity. Women's capacity development is becoming a contribution to the family and society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that three state universities still play an important role for education. The three universities are: Royal University of Phnom Penh, Royal University of Law and Economics and National University of Management.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that geopolitical competition, especially nuclear-powered ships, is a concern for the world.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the world will face more serious problems if there is an arms race.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed the expectation that the United States and China will be able to find a compromise to avoid any problems.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has high hopes that Cambodia will become a high middle income country by 2030
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulates the students of the Royal University of Law and Economics who graduated and received their degrees this morning. Samdech Techo confirmed that these achievements do not fall from the sky, but from the effort.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that leaders do not strive to develop capacity like a stone pressed against a sprout.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the past cannot be changed. But the past has become an experiment for the present and the future.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the opening ceremony of the ASEAN Para Games is not inferior to the opening of the SEA Games. SEA Games, one person flying, ASEAN Para Games, up to 10 people flying.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the organization of the SEA Games and the ASEAN Para Games has contributed to strengthening the unity and friendship of more than 600 million Southeast Asian nations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's reputation in hosting the SEA Games and the ASEAN Para Games is endless and will leave Cambodian children for hundreds of years to come.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns athletes with disabilities not to be discouraged by the results of the competition, but to do well as the host.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to express his expectation that ASEAN will bid for the Olympic and World Cup.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his desire for ASEAN to form an ASEAN football team that can take two strong players from ASEAN member countries.
