* First name: Tang Cheng Meng, male, 32 years old, ethnic Khmer, living in Phav village, Phav commune, Batheay district, Kampong Cham province * Second: Name: Him Lisa, male, 20 years old, ethnic Khmer, living in Po village, Tbeng commune, Kampong Svay district, Kampong Thom province * Third: Prang Sith, alias Hin Set, alias Hin Chea Pisith, male, 49 years old, ethnic Khmer, living in Po village, Tbeng commune, Kampong Svay district, Kampong Thom province.
Until June 2, 2023 at 11:47 by determining the hiding place of the above suspects, the Criminal Police Department leads the specialized force of Kampong Cham Provincial Police and Siem Reap Provincial Police in accordance with the arrest warrant of the prosecutor. The Kampong Cham Provincial Court cracked down on and detained the three suspects at a charcoal burning site in Rong Roeung village, Kantuot commune, Svay Leu district, Siem Reap province.
After the killing, they put the head in a black bag and threw it at a pond in Kampong Thmor commune, Baray district, Kampong Thom province, while the ax was thrown at the bridge in Batheay district. Kampong Cham, and after stealing some money, they hid in Rong Roeung village, Kantuot commune, Svay Leu district, Siem Reap province, and were arrested by the authorities.
