(Phnom Penh): Ms. Chhay Sivalin, President of the Cambodian Association of Travel Agents, considers modern technology as an important contribution that pushes the tourism sector in Cambodia to grow and attract more visitors.
In a joint workshop between the Cambodian Association of Travel Agents and Travelport on the evening of June 2, 2023, Ms. Chhay Sivalin claimed that digital technology, especially airline booking, hotel and car online, is also a factor. Important to facilitate tourists as well.
The president of the Cambodian Association of Travel Agents claims that Travelport, a global provider of airline, hotel and car booking services, is contributing to attracting more and more tourists to Cambodia. Care should be taken in the use of this system.
Ms. Chhay Sivalin said, "We are holding this workshop to introduce tour operators, airline ticket holders, frozen awareness of new products, new technologies that are increasingly demanded by the tourism sector to meet the needs of operators." Travel around the world. In the past, we used to use a lot, but from one stage to another, there is progress that we want all operators to understand more deeply.
Ms. Chhay Sivalin also strongly believes that the modernization of technology, especially the booking of airline tickets, hotels and cars, all contribute to the growth of tourism as operators provide airline booking services. The more options, the more comprehensive and accessible to any country.
He added that Travelport is a system that the world uses in tourism related to airlines, so all tour operators when using the airline to use this system to know exactly what the ticket price is good and the airline. Which one is better to meet the needs of its customers?
