Svay Rieng City Authority Calls on Citizens Not to Release Cattle on Open Roads That Cause Traffic Accidents
(Svay Rieng): In order to prevent traffic accidents that often occur on public roads in Svay Rieng City, Svay Rieng Province, Svay Rieng Municipality authorities have appealed and disseminated to people who raise cattle not to be reckless to participate in preventing To cause traffic accidents on the road.
Mr. Saing Lay, Deputy Director of Administration of Svay Rieng City Hall, said this morning, June 2, 2023, that with the order of the Governor of Svay Rieng, he led a team to promote the release of animals on the streets without control. Accurate as a wake-up call for pet owners to be extra vigilant as well as contribute to reducing traffic accidents on public roads.
He said that traffic accidents on public roads are usually caused by many factors, including human factors, vehicle factors, road factors, animal factors and so on. But in the meantime, he would like to mention the animal factors that often cause traffic accidents because animal owners no longer move carelessly.
He added that on behalf of the Governor of Svay Rieng, he appealed to the people who raise animals, especially cattle owners, to raise with high responsibility, that is, to take good care of management, not to leave the open field that leads to danger. In particular, causing traffic accidents that cause the loss of property of themselves and others, because in the geography of Svay Rieng, there are a lot of cars transporting factory workers and people traveling to and fro.
In addition, Mr. Saing Lay also called on the people to continue to respect the road traffic law for everyone, not to drive over the speed limit, not to be overweight, not to carry heavy, not to drive in the situation. Drunk driving at high risk, especially always wear a seat belt and helmet when driving on the road to be connected.
