General Assembly and Election of Svay Rieng Provincial Medical Council, Dr. Kuch Sitha was elected Chairman of the Provincial Medical Council for the 4th term for the 4th term.
(Svay Rieng): Prof. Lam Eng Hour, Vice Chairman of the National Medical Council, Representative of Professor Thea Kruy, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health and Chairman of the National Medical Council, on the morning of June 2, 2023, opened the General Assembly. Results of the activities of the Svay Rieng Provincial Medical Council for the third 6-year mandate and working directions, as well as the election of the Svay Rieng Provincial Medical Council for the fourth six-year mandate.
The General Assembly was held at the meeting hall of the Provincial Health Department with the participation of Dr. Kuch Sitha, Director of the Svay Rieng Provincial Health Department, the Chairman of the Professional Committee and more than 100 members of the Medical Association.
Speaking on that occasion, Prof. Lam Eng Hour, Vice Chairman of the National Medical Council, paid a courtesy call on Prof. Mam Bun Heng, Minister of Health and praised the Svay Rieng Provincial Medical Council for the third six-year term. Who have strived to develop the profession in the health sector effectively.
