Stop a new timber truck embedded in an old house without a permit in O'Kreang Sen Chey district
(Kratie): Sangkat forces of O'Kreang Forestry Administration, in cooperation with environmental officials of Sambo Wildlife Sanctuary, cracked down on a large truck transporting new timber embedded in an old house without a permit from the Forestry Administration at O'Kreang village, O'Kreang commune, O'Kreang Sen Chey district, Kratie province. .
