On the other hand, the Cambodian Association of Obstetrics and Gynecology has been working closely with various international obstetric and gynecological associations, such as the Japanese Obstetrics and Gynecology Association, through which this wonderful international collaboration will continue to grow.
It is with great pleasure and pride that we all celebrate one of the countless great achievements under the auspices of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen. Additional confirmation by the professor.
