The ceremony was held at the Theater of the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center on June 1, 2023.
Samdech Men Sam An recommended some of the following:
3. Ministries, relevant institutions, local authorities at all levels, development partners, civil society organizations must pay attention to increase the participation of children and youth at all levels, especially in the preparation of laws, policies, legal documents related to survival. Their needs, challenges and concerns.
4. Ministries, institutions, development partners and civil society organizations must take action to protect children from the use of digital technology by educating youth and children, parents and caregivers, as well as online child safety social services to understand the risks of online systems. Define security and privacy functions, as well as secure reporting and application methods.
5. Relevant ministries and institutions must continue to implement the core conventions of the International Labor Organization to eliminate all forms of child labor, including raising awareness, training, disseminating and strengthening inspection measures to exclude children from the form of labor.
6. All public and private radio and television stations, as well as social media, continue to promote the protection of children from trafficking, exploitation, all forms of violence and abuse of children online, especially to improve the quality of programs for Educate children to prevent children from becoming victims.
