Ratanakkiri: The Ratanakkiri Provincial Court on May 30, 2023, decided to release Theng Savoeun, Nhel Pheap and Than Hach on bail on charges of "conspiracy and incitement." "The act caused serious chaos to social security."
After their release, the three released a video expressing their regret for their actions and thanking Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister, and Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng for their generosity. At the same time, they have vowed not to believe in the lure of foreign individuals and extremist politicians.
Please be informed that Mr. Theng Savoeun, President of the Farmers' Association in Ratanakkiri Province, on May 27, 2023, wrote a letter and video apologizing from prison for what he had done in the past, believing in the incitement of the opposition and foreigners. Some.
