At the same time, many employees, including cleaners, security guards, and many others, complained that they were facing problems in their daily lives and needed to earn a living and pay the bank. The bank also wants to seize assets.
The staff of Sika Kang International Casino continued that they are protesting today in order to want the relevant authorities, especially Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Sihanoukville to intervene and find a solution as soon as possible.
Two days later, the workers rallied to demand that the Department of Labor help the owner of the owner of the hotel, Si Kang International Hotel, pay them, but apparently the above location was closed and did not meet with The owner of the company.
So far, the Department of Labor has prepared the relevant documents to report to the provincial leadership and sent to the relevant ministries and courts, but what the provincial governor has responded is that even though the above location is open. However, the company owner has not yet fulfilled that obligation, unless there is a solution to pay the workers first. All relevant authorities must pay close attention to this.
