(Phnom Penh): The President of the Council of Judges of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, Mr. Pich Vicheathor, has decided to raise the case of forgery of public documents, use of forged public documents and illegal use of clothing, especially for public authorities, to announce the verdict on June 21, 2023
The decision of the President of the Trial Chamber was made on the morning of 30 May 2023 after the Trial Chamber concluded the cross-examination of the Trial Chamber, the defense counsel representing the detainees. One of the accused, Thirith Sochantha, 25, was absent from the other nine defendants who were charged with conspiracy.
