(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Cambodia on May 20, 2023 issued a circular on the organization of the 74th anniversary of International Children's Day, June 1, the 22nd anniversary of the World Day Against Child Labor, June 12 and Cambodian Children's Day 2023.
