At the same time, the Minister thanked the French Embassy in Cambodia for facilitating the provision of international technical experts to the University of Health Sciences to support the implementation of research and training of staff and students of the University of Health Sciences. The Minister also thanked ANRS for supporting research projects at the University of Health Sciences.
"I appreciate these fruitful cooperation and especially the efforts of Dr. Olivier Segeral in the past," he said. "I hope that he will continue to help the University of Health Sciences, even though he has already completed his term at the University of Health Sciences."
The Minister continued, "As a token of gratitude for the efforts of Dr., the Royal Government of Cambodia has decided to provide the best of the best in partnership with the Thepdin class."
