(Kampong Speu): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, and Joseph Scheuer, UN Resident Coordinator in Cambodia, on the morning of May 29, 2023, organized the International Day of the Armed Forces. Keep the United Nations peace and lay a wreath to commemorate the peacekeepers who sacrificed their lives in the mission area under the United Nations umbrella.
On that occasion, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh said that today is the celebration of the 75th anniversary of the "International Day of the United Nations Peacekeeping Force", which is the most proud day for countries to send peacekeepers to participate in the mission of the organization. The United Nations to express its gratitude to the peacekeepers who sacrificed their lives for the cause of world peace and security.
Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh stated that the sacrifices of the peacekeepers at all stages have contributed significantly to alleviating the difficulties of helping countries facing the crisis of chronic war, landmines and explosive remnants of war. And natural disasters to improve livelihoods.
