General Sem Sovanny, First Vice President of the National Committee and Director General of the National Peacekeeping Center, said that in 2023, this is the 31st anniversary of the United Nations' establishment of a peacekeeping mission in Cambodia (UNTAC) to Contribute to the restoration of peace in Cambodia from the civil war and the holding of the first elections in Cambodia.
