He stated that through the mainstreaming and sharing of experience in implementing the new procedures in the FMIS system completely on all current budget expenditures from the technical officers and secretariats of the FMIS project management team, all budget units of the Ministry of Environment In particular, sub-national units will receive additional information and knowledge as a basis for preparing to participate in and use the FMIS system with the implementation of new procedures.
