(Phnom Penh): The National University of Northwest China of Cambodia, the Cambodian-Chinese Coalition Association in Cambodia, supported by the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia, the Nationalities Affairs Committee of China and the Ministry of Culture and Arts of Cambodia on May 27. Performing "Chinese Diversity for the Year of Sino-Cambodian Friendship" 2023 at the Chenla Theater in Phnom Penh to celebrate the 65th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Cambodia.
