Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Samdech's Disability Became a Force for Samdech to Overthrow the Khmer Rouge (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, said that Samdech's disability has become A force for Samdech to defeat the Khmer Rouge until it succeeds and brings complete peace to Cambodia and all rights and freedoms to the Cambodian people throughout the country.
This statement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was made on the afternoon of May 26, 2023, during the meeting with the delegation of the ASEAN Para Games at the Peace Palace.
Cambodia's strongman said: "What is the endurance of the disabled? How did you all experience the disability, how did I get through all the disability, and how did I stand up to defeat the regime?" Pol Pot and how to stand up to continue until today ...! "
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for the spirit of endurance, people with disabilities can be a little more resilient, and disability is also part of the psychology for overcoming obstacles.
The head of the Royal Government added that Samdech's all-out struggle to save lives and the country from the Khmer Rouge regime, one-sided, without any hesitation, has made Cambodia fully peaceful. Khmer people live in peace and have all kinds of rights and freedoms.
Samdech Techo confirmed this during the meeting to recommend and encourage the ASEAN Para Games delegation on the afternoon of May 26, 2023 at the Peace Palace.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen expects that the ASEAN Paralympic Games of Cambodia will get good results in the spirit of competition, success and gestures to raise the image of the country.
The Prime Minister encouraged the national team players to work hard for the tournament and this match is not just to win, what must be grasped first is the rules of the game, the rules of the game Do not use any method that violates the rules of the game.
Samdech Techo added that in case we win, we must know how to encourage our opponents to be friends with us in the future. Be clear. Unreasonable protests are not self-defeating or self-defeating.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as the Prime Minister of Cambodia and the President of the National Paralympic Committee of Cambodia, has high hopes for all Cambodian athletes.
The beast here, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, refers to the leaders of the opposition who do not dare to applaud what the nation has done, including the successful organization of the SEA Games, the inclusion of UNESCO's intangible and intangible cultural heritage of humanity.
During a meeting with the ASEAN Para Games delegation, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "Calling animals is not too bad for those who do not see the national achievement. But for the people, there are a lot of people who accept this national pride. "Although some opposition groups still recognize that this is the achievement of their nation, they do not dare to speak out for fear of being told they support the CPP."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the opposition is very stupid and does not know how to celebrate the victory, even the victory of the athletes in the SEA Games, especially Bou Samnang. Bou Samnang attracts Cambodians and the world.
Cambodia successfully hosted the 32nd SEA Games from May 5 to 17, 2023. In this sporting event, Cambodia won a total of 282 medals, ranking third with the most medals and fourth with the most gold medals.
During the meeting with the athletes of the 12th ASEAN Para Games on the afternoon of May 26, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the budget can be spent at any time, but the reputation of the SEA Games in Cambodia is It does not end there, leaving a good reputation for future generations.
According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Cambodia's success in hosting the SEA Games and the ASEAN Para Games at this time is due to the fact that Cambodia's hardware and software infrastructure has been greatly strengthened and the achievements of The past, too.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "Our costs are far lower than other countries, but we have achieved more than we expected." Hardware and software infrastructure has been greatly strengthened, our sports base is designed not only for the 2023 SEA Games, I think what we have organized, our past achievements will be passed on to our children. In the long run. ”
Samdech Techo Prime Minister explained that the hardware is well prepared and he believes that in the future is the basis for the game will continue to organize according to its needs and the growth of sports. We. Our software is very large, as the prince pointed out, money can be spent, but Cambodia's reputation is not exhausted, we keep our nation for our descendants for hundreds of years to come.
It should be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia has spent more than 110 million dollars to organize the 32nd SEA Games 2023. This does not include the ASEAN Para Games, which require an additional $ 30 million to $ 40 million at the ASEAN Para Games.
