WASHINGTON, May 29 (Xinhua) - US Secretary of State Antony Blinken is scheduled to visit Sweden, Norway and Finland from May 29 to June 2 to strengthen cooperation, the State Department said on Friday. Deepen operations on national security and the economy as Russia's war in Ukraine continues. This is according to the release by the AFP news agency on Friday, May 26, 2023.
