TIKA is headquartered in 60 countries, cooperating in more than 150 countries, with the main activity being technical cooperation for the development of human resource institutions. TIKA also finances infrastructure projects such as irrigation, sanitation and transportation projects, as well as the construction and renovation of schools, hospitals, architecture and humanitarian assistance.
