(Battambang): After the departure of the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, Cambodia under the strong leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister has cleared a lot of mines and explosive remnants of war to save the lives of the people of Cambodia. Millions of people everywhere will be provided with tens of thousands of hectares of safe land for village building and cultivation, as well as the discovery and destruction of millions of landmines and unexploded ordnance.
