Mr. Kong Vibol: There is no delay in the implementation of the new tax law because the new law as well as the old law just gather together (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Mr. Kong Vibol, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Director General of the General The General Department of Taxation has stated that the General Department of Taxation has no policy to delay the implementation of the new tax law, as the new law, like the old law, is only gathered.
This statement was made on the occasion of Mr. Kong Vibol's participation in a special program on tax law organized by the General Department of Taxation this morning, May 25, 2023.
Mr. Kong Vibol said that the old tax law and the new tax law are the same, just what the General Department of Taxation has compiled from the previous code or decree, and only some revisions and modernizations. Keep the same list, all taxes and tax rates remain the same.
Please be informed that the tax law was announced by the National Assembly on April 19, 2023 at the 9th session of the National Assembly, 9th legislature, after the Senate fully reviewed the form and concept of this law on May 2, 2023, during the 10th plenary session of the 4th legislature.
This law sets out the rules, procedures and conditions, as well as compiles the tax regulations in order to control the collection of taxes for the benefit of the state budget. This law applies to the management of all types of tax collection as stated in this law in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
