(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism organized an inter-ministerial consultation workshop on the draft "National Strategic Plan for Tourism Development 2023-2035" chaired by Mr. Hor Sarun, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism, representing Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism this morning. May 24, 2023 at the Ministry of Tourism with participants from relevant ministries / institutions, capital / province administration and many private sectors.
Mr. Nep Samuth continued that this national strategic plan also set out three strategic goals, including:
* The first strategic goal focuses on enhancing tourism competitiveness with five key strategies, including: 1-Development of innovative, innovative and Khmer tourism products, 2-Marketing, marketing and tourism attraction, 3 Strengthening the quality and safety of tourism, 4-Building infrastructure to support the connection and facilitation of tourism, 5-Promoting Khmer identity in tourism.
* The second strategic goal focuses on promoting sustainable tourism with three main strategies, including: 1. Strengthening human capital in tourism, 2. Promoting economic, social, cultural sustainability and negative impact management in tourism. 3. Promoting environmental sustainability and natural resources in response to climate change.
* The third strategic goal focuses on improving the tourism environment with two main strategies, including: 1. Strengthening the development of tourism for all. 2. Promoting the informal tourism economy.
The workshop also received more input from the private sector in the tourism sector to contribute to the comprehensive strategic plan for tourism development 2023-2035 to be more comprehensive, diverse and ensure sustainability.
On that occasion, Secretary of State Hor Sarun made recommendations and requested the working group to update the draft national strategic plan according to the content and input of the workshop.
The Secretary of State continued that as a procedure, after adjusting the spirit of the workshop, the working group must prepare the draft of the National Strategic Plan respectfully requesting Minister Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism to submit in the meeting of the working group of the Royal Government and the private sector. To restore and promote tourism in Cambodia during and after the Kovid-19 crisis.
