The Deputy Prime Minister also thanked the Australian Government for providing scholarships to Cambodian students every year. Australia has also provided agricultural assistance and provided $ 52 million in development assistance in 2022-2023. The Deputy Prime Minister also proposed to increase trade between the two countries by 2022, with a trade volume of just over 500 million US dollars.
